      "text": "[](https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-community-bench/stargazers)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-community-bench)\n[](https://dshfind.com/plugins/PerryLink/dsh-community-bench?ref=badge)\n[](https://gitee.com/perrylink/dsh-community-bench)\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile <name> add dsh-community-bench\n```\n\n</div>\n\n<sub>Community plugin, not affiliated with DeepSeek. Canonical repository: <https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-community-bench> (Gitee is a mirror).</sub>"
